# Dxun, passage to Onderon (TSL, 403DXN, 501OND): Mandalore, his reward
# for the detonator given (dxun_tests), says the Exile has proven himself
# ("You've made quite a reputation around here"), ready to go
# now; Mandalore, Zuka and Kreia at the shuttle (mand_cs1), the Sith
# assassins' attack on the camp (Zuka's alarm, Kelborn and Kumus joining
# in) fought in the hall and the lower camp, Mandalore's "head to Iziz immediately", the party screen
# with Mandalore made a companion (p_mand) and Mira chosen, the shuttle to
# Iziz (OndMov05).
# Starts from the battle circle's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @dxun_champion data/routes/tsl/dxun_departure.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Mandalore" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Left: Kex's store.
#
# ASSUMES:
# - Mandalore's tests done (dxun_tests, dxun_circle): c_pp_done true, his
#   hub says so at once, and its talk about the detonator came before the
#   champion's (it is offered only before the Exile has proven himself).
# - a_mand_cs1 plays mand_cs1 start 0 (the shuttle check, Kreia jumped to
#   sp_mcs1_kreia though she is not in the party) and start 1 (Kreia's
#   speech to Mandalore) as two conversations.
# - The assassins come as the party walks back through the hall
#   (tr_sith_att_1); sith_att's cut-ins play within the fight, its last
#   start is Mandalore's call to leave (a_to_iziz: the party screen with
#   Mandalore forced, its exit a_to_iziz2 to 501OND).
# - Party for Onderon: Mandalore (NPC 2, forced) and Mira (NPC 7),
#   DSimpson's light-side pick (Mira's bounty hunters and Anda lines).
equip saber          # the saber in hand
say Have I proven myself yet? # (four tests: the hub says so itself)
say I'm ready to go now. # a_open_door, a_mand_cs1
say Let's go.
wait 2s              # BLOCKER: off the beat of Mandalore's heartbeat (below)
use g_mandalore
talk
talk                 # Mandalore, Zuka and Kreia at the shuttle (mand_cs1)
talk                 # Kreia's words to Mandalore (mand_cs1 start 1)
party 2,7            # Mandalore (forced) and Mira
to tr_sith_att_1     # the Sith assassins (sith_att): Zuka's alarm
talk
fight 40
if in 403dxn         # still in camp (the hall's fight may chase down the
to tr_sith_att_2     # lower camp's too): the lower camp's assassins
fight 30             # (DSimpson: don't forget them; k_403_hb waits for its
end                  # tr_sith_att's word):
module 501ond        # Mandalore's call to Iziz and the party screen come
                     # as the last falls, the throne room and his word on
                     # Iziz as the shuttle lands
save onderon_spaceport
